    "text": "THE SILVER CITY DAILY PRESS\nwebsite\nGrant County, New Mexico\nTUESDAY NIGHT UPDATE: Firefighters work to hold Trout Fire at NM 35\nBy Juno Ogle,\n1 days agoOn Tuesday evening, the U.S. Forest Service expanded their emergency closure due to the spread of the Trout Fire to encompass much of the forest in central and northern Grant County. The closure will remain in place until further notice. The closure has Tom Moore Canyon as its northern border,...",
